~ start
if not Dialogue.started_acorn_quest:
	set Dialogue.started_acorn_quest = true
	=> quest_start
elif not Dialogue.can_finish_acorn_quest:
	=> quest_in_progress
elif Dialogue.finished_acorn_quest:
	Ol' Man Acorn: I don't need any more help right now! Maybe you should leave a comment for the game instead?
elif Dialogue.can_finish_acorn_quest:
	set Dialogue.finished_acorn_quest = true
	=> quest_complete
=> END

~ quest_start
Ol' Man Acorn: [shake rate=20 level=10]Those blasted boars![/shake]
Rudolph: Sorry?
Ol' Man Acorn: There's a group of wild boars that keep breaking my fence [shake rate=15 level=5][i]and trampling my flowers![/i][/shake]
Rudolph: That's terrible!
Ol' Man Acorn: Tragically so!
Rudolph: And rude!!
Ol' Man Acorn: So you understand!!
Rudolph: And fixing all of that must be quite expensive!!!
Ol' Man Acorn: Well! Yes! It is!
Rudolph: I understand. We'll take care of them for you
Ol' Man Acorn: Really? That would be a big help
Rudolph: Of course! And think of how much money you'll save in the long run!
Ol' Man Acorn: ... Ah-ha
Ol' Man Acorn: Very well! Come and see me when the problem is... [shake rate=20 level=10]*ahem*[/shake] [i]dealt with[/i]
=> END

~ quest_in_progress
Ol' Man Acorn: Back so soon?
Rudolph: We were just passing by. We'll go find those wild boars and deal with them for you now!
Ol' Man Acorn: Brilliant! I think I saw them head somewhere towards the east!
=> END

~ quest_complete
Rudolph: Those boars won't be bothering you or your garden anymore
Ol' Man Acorn: [wave amp=25 freq=5]Wonderful![/wave]
Ol' Man Acorn: Here, take this
Rudolph: That's... Amazing! Thank you
Rudolph: Let us know if you need help with anything else 
Ol' Man Acorn: Let's hope not! [wave amp=50 freq=5][shake rate=15 level=5]Heh heh heh[/shake][/wave]
=> END

